<title>FRANCE: Valeo sells bus heating unit in Germany.</title>
<headline>Valeo sells bus heating unit in Germany.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car equipment supplier Valeo said its Valeo Climatisation division had signed a contract to sell a bus heating and cooling systems unit in Hockenheim, Germany, to Westinghouse Electric GmbH.</p>
<p>Valeo did not disclose the terms but said the unit generates annual sales of 27 million marks, or around 90 million francs. Valeo said in a statement that Valeo Climatisation will concentrate on heating and cooling systems for cars and trucks.</p>
</text>
